  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Education and Research within Energy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Universidade Eduardo Mondlane (UEM) has partnered with University of Lurio (UniLurio) and the Norwegian University of Science and Technology (NTNU) to enhance existing study programmes in PetEng. Also, the aim is to develop a research programme related to oil &amp; gas, and to some degree to environmental challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
